{
  "notes": [
    "exhaust_per_area is cfm/ft2 of the space type's floor area.",
    "The legacy space_type/building_type keys are DOE prototype names and are KEPT: prototype models set standardsSpaceType to those names, and dropping them would strip exhaust from every prototype build.",
    "all_level_space_types crosswalks each record onto the all-level space type taxonomy, which is what create_typical builds from. Only one record carries a given all-level name, so the lookup is deterministic.",
    "Records with an empty all_level_space_types carry all_level_exclusion_reason. Two reasons appear: the all-level taxonomy has no name specific enough to hold the rate without spreading it over unrelated space (Anesthesia, Soil Work), or another record already owns the all-level name (the duplicate kitchens, MRI_Control, Toilet)."
  ],
